  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Kinetic energy surrounds your target, locking them in place.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. They must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be <strong>Restrained</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>You may choose to inflict <strong>Damage</strong> on them by squeezing them while you have them in your grip. If you do so, they take <strong>1 Damage</strong> at the start of their turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the number of targets by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You can also increase <strong>Damage</strong> inflicted by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.uI6HQAV4iMLFSwWh]{Force Chains}</p>",
